cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "score-based-diffusion: score-based diffusion models via SDEs"
abstract: >-
  A PyTorch implementation of score-based generative modeling through stochastic
  differential equations (VP, VE and sub-VP SDEs), with reverse-SDE and probability-flow
  samplers, applied from 2D toy distributions to 64x64 images.
authors:
  - given-names: "Iván Agustín"
    family-names: Bravo
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/bravoivanagustin/score-based-diffusion"
url: "https://github.com/bravoivanagustin/score-based-diffusion"
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - diffusion models
  - score-based generative models
  - stochastic differential equations
  - pytorch
